00:44:26.000 --> 00:44:28.385
Ay, Spanyol, Spanyol, Spanyol.

00:44:29.796 --> 00:44:31.296
Dia kacau

00:44:33.506 --> 00:44:34.506
impulsif

00:44:36.503 --> 00:44:37.503
